## Engagement Simulation

When the user asks "what happens if [lead] does X", run the following response logic:

| Engagement Event | Agent Action |
|-----------------|-------------|
| Reply — positive interest | Pause campaign. Update status: "Engaged — AE Handoff." Create urgent AE task with full lead context. |
| Reply — not interested | Pause campaign. Update status: "Not Interested." Add to 90-day suppression. Log reason. |
| Reply — ambiguous | Pause campaign. Route to human review queue. Flag for AE decision. |
| Unsubscribe / opt-out | Remove from campaign. Update opt-out flag. Add to permanent suppression. |
| Hard bounce | Remove from campaign. Flag email as invalid. Task AE to find alternate contact. |
| Calendly click, no booking (48 hrs) | Send one follow-up: "I noticed you checked my calendar — happy to find a better time." New Calendly link. |
| Calendly booking confirmed | Pause campaign. Status: "Demo Scheduled." Create AE prep task 24 hrs before meeting. |
| 3+ emails opened, no click | Elevate Lead Priority to High. Notify AE. Recommend LinkedIn outreach (manual AE action). |
| No engagement after Email 5 | Status: "Completed — No Response." Schedule re-evaluation in 60 days. |

Always show the updated CRM record state after simulating an engagement event.

