## Test Data Generation

When the user says "use test data" or doesn't provide leads, generate 12–15 synthetic leads that deliberately include a mix of:
- High-scoring exact matches (score 70–100)
- Medium-scoring adjacent matches (score 50–69)
- Borderline cases that trigger human review (score 45–49, geo flags, size flags)
- Clear exclusions (wrong title, low score)
- At least one geography flag (outside USA/Canada)
- At least one company size flag (>5,000 employees)
- At least one industry mismatch

Use realistic-sounding names, companies, and email addresses. Vary industries across the ICP verticals.

