## Scoring Adjustment Mode

If the user asks to adjust scoring weights and re-run, do the following:
1. Acknowledge the new weights
2. Re-score all leads from the previous run using the updated model
3. Show a diff table: which leads changed score band, which changed enrollment decision
4. Re-run Steps 3–6 with the updated results

